cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "crbirding" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'crbirding: Prepare CR-Birding Data For Publication'
version: 0.0.0.9000
abstract: Prepare colour-ring data from 'CR-Briding' (<https://cr-birding.org/>) for
  publication in a research repository. With 'crbirding' you can transform CR-Birding
  data to Darwin Core for publication to the Global Biodiversity Information Facility
  ('GBIF') and the Ocean Biodiversity Information System ('OBIS').
